   "stem_html": "According to Betty Friedan, the statement “Is this all?” represented",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1174107,
     "content_html": "the civil rights movement’s unfulfilled promises after the <i>Brown v. Board of Education</i> decision"
    },
    {
     "id": 1174108,
     "content_html": "a critique of the suburban homemaker’s life after World War II"
    },
    {
     "id": 1174106,
     "content_html": "a response to the youth culture of the post–World War II baby boom"
    },
    {
     "id": 1174105,
     "content_html": "disgust at the Kennedy administration’s inadequate response to violence against civil rights workers"
    }
